Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 19:47:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Moyoung: add MT55 support

MT55 is a MOYOUNG-V2 watch (manufacturer string 'MOYOUNG-V2', software
'MOY-JSB2-2.0.4'). Confirmed over GATT: advertises service 0xFEEA with
FEE1/FEE2/FEE3/FEE5/FEE6 present; battery and the 9-byte FEE1 pedometer
payload both decode correctly.

ECG characteristics (FEE7/FEE8) are absent, as is Model Number (0x2A24).
